desc: Off the Cuff (KoniSynth OPL port) by chmaha
tags: instrument synthesizer FM
author: chmaha
version: 1.0
changelog:
  Initial release.
about:
  Yamaha OPL FM chips: YM3526 (OPL), YM3812 (OPL2: AdLib, Sound Blaster) and YMF262 (OPL3: Sound Blaster Pro 2 / 16),
  with rhythm mode and General MIDI through the DMX driver (Doom, Heretic, Hexen) and the DMXOPL3 bank.
  Ported from the KoniSynth OPL engine by k0n1m4k1, https://github.com/k0n1m4k1/KoniSynth (AGPL-3.0),
  which follows the chip behaviour documented by Nuked-OPL3 (Nuke.YKT).
  DMXOPL3 General MIDI bank by sneakernets, https://github.com/sneakernets/DMXOPL (MIT). Credit: "DMXOPL3".
  DMX driver rules as reconstructed by Chocolate Doom (GPL-2.0-or-later).
  AdLib Gold stage: TDA8425_emu and YM7128B_emu by Andrea Zoppi (BSD-2-Clause), as used by KoniSynth.
  Yamaha, AdLib and Sound Blaster are trademarks of their owners; no affiliation.
  JSFX version released under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0
  Claude generated some of this code

